INSTALL
-------

To build with ant :
extract the tarball into a folder;
open shell and browse to the folder;
ant clean

To pack into .jar (dist/yourOSname/) :
ant jar

To pack extensions .jar if available :
ant DO-jar-extension

For Linux users only, to install into /usr/games/projectname) :
su
ant install

To build and run applet/application without install :
ant run-applet
  or
ant run